    "tutorial": {
        "label": "How to play",
        "text": {
            "1": "All Pokémon on the grid belong to groups according to their common traits. You must find out what those groups are in the least attempts possible.",
            "2": "You can check the accuracy of incorrect guesses to try and deduce which Pokémon belong to the same group.",
            "3": "It's also possible to ask for hints, such as which Pokémon should be grouped or what trait defines that group.",
            "4": "By pressing or right-clicking a Pokémon, you may check all its relevant information.",
            "5": "You win by correctly sorting all Pokémon on the grid into their groups. Theere are as many groups as there are rows in the puzzle grid."
        }
    },
